### Primary credit bureau (CIBIL-like) - REST Connector "Request credit score – primary bureau"
POST http://localhost:8081/mock/credit-bureau/primary/assessments
Content-Type: application/json

< ./credit-assessment-request.json

### Primary bureau failure: HTTP 500 -> BPMN error PRIMARY_BUREAU_DOWN -> the process asks the backup bureau
POST http://localhost:8081/mock/credit-bureau/primary/assessments
Content-Type: application/json

{"applicationId": "LA-06", "applicantId": "APP-ERR-500"}

### Primary bureau timeout: answers after 8 s, the connector read timeout is 5 s (HTTP 408) -> backup bureau
POST http://localhost:8081/mock/credit-bureau/primary/assessments
Content-Type: application/json

{"applicationId": "LA-07", "applicantId": "APP-TIMEOUT"}

### Backup credit bureau (second provider) - REST Connector "Request credit score – backup bureau"
POST http://localhost:8081/mock/credit-bureau/backup/assessments
Content-Type: application/json

{"applicationId": "LA-06", "applicantId": "APP-ERR-500"}

### Fault injection: break / repair dependencies
GET http://localhost:8081/admin/faults

###
POST http://localhost:8081/admin/faults/primary-bureau-down?enabled=true

###
POST http://localhost:8081/admin/faults/backup-bureau-down?enabled=true

###
POST http://localhost:8081/admin/faults/validation-reference-data?enabled=true

### Start a process instance (Orchestration Cluster API, unprotected local Camunda 8 Run)
POST http://localhost:8080/v2/process-instances
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "processDefinitionId": "loan-approval",
  "variables": {
    "applicationId": "LA-DEMO-1", "applicantId": "APP-1001", "fullName": "Synthetic Applicant Alpha",
    "email": "synthetic.applicant.alpha@example.org", "age": 35, "employmentStatus": "EMPLOYED",
    "monthlyIncome": 6200, "monthlyDebtPayments": 400, "loanAmount": 25000, "loanTermMonths": 60,
    "loanPurpose": "Home renovation", "offerAcceptanceTimeout": "PT2M"
  }
}

### Applicant sends the missing details (correlates to "Wait for corrected details")
POST http://localhost:8080/v2/messages/publication
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "corrected-details-received", "correlationKey": "LA-DEMO-1", "variables": {"email": "synthetic.applicant.alpha@example.org"}}

### Applicant accepts the loan offer (correlates to "Wait for offer acceptance"); false = declined
POST http://localhost:8080/v2/messages/publication
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "loan-offer-response", "correlationKey": "LA-DEMO-1", "variables": {"offerAccepted": true}}
